WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,880
Wang Sheng, open the door for me, you coward

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,880
You actually have the nerve to abandon your wife and run home alone?

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:15,420
Xiaoyue, are you okay?

4
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,420
Come in quickly, or that group of people will rush over again.

5
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,420
Wang Sheng, are you still not a man?

6
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,420
How did you get involved with Shanmeng Maritime with me before we got married?

7
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,420
Ah, if you encounter danger, just leave it alone and run away.

8
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:26,100
I'm just blind to marry you

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,100
That's it, Xiaoyue, I'm not afraid

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,100
Didn't I ask someone for help?

11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,100
Just no one wants to help me

12
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,100
I really can't help it

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,100
I came back to find a job to save you.

14
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,100
You have to believe me, Xiaoyue

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,100
Then why are you closing the door?

16
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,820
I ate everything I could eat and drink at home.

17
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,820
I even lost my Jinzhuo just now

18
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,820
What should I do?

19
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,820
I'm still young

20
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,820
I don’t want to starve to death with you
